# Anatolia Ancient Sites Dataset

**A comprehensive dataset of ancient Anatolian sites for LLM-based storytelling and automated narrative generation research.**

This repository contains the dataset used in the study regarding automated storytelling agents. It includes historical narratives, structured metadata, and specific text variants (summarized/truncated) for **N=89** ancient sites in Anatolia.

## 📂 Dataset Contents

The main file `anatolia_ancient_sites.csv` contains the following columns:

| Column Name | Description | Source / Method |
| :--- | :--- | :--- |
| **`City`** | Name of the ancient site. | Wikipedia Title |
| **`history_section`** | The raw, cleaned historical text extracted from the source. | Wikipedia API + Regex Cleaning |
| **`history_excerpt_40`** | The first 40% of the sentences from the history section (used to test partial context). | Truncation Logic |
| **`infobox`** | Structured Key-Value data extracted from the HTML infobox. | BeautifulSoup Parsing |
| **`info_box`** | A coherent, human-readable paragraph generated from the structured infobox data. | LLM Transformation (Zero-shot) |

